			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Centralize URI sanitization and expand IPC macro overloads\n\nExtend the `call!` macro in `WindServiceHandlers` with a new overload for handlers accepting no arguments (app, tag, msg, Fn), replacing verbose inline logging and `RunTime.clone()` boilerplate across Extensions, Decorations, WorkingCopy, Keybinding, and Lifecycle dispatchers in `mountain_ipc_invoke`.\n\nConcurrently extract the `StripFileUriScheme` logic from `FileReadAlias.rs` into the centralized `Utilities::Params` module as `strip_file_uri`. Update `FileReadAlias.rs` to import this helper, unifying file URI normalization (handling `file://`, `file:///`, and `file://localhost` forms) across the request tracking layer and aligning with the project's utility standardization efforts.\n\nThis reduces code duplication in the IPC dispatcher and ensures consistent path handling for file system operations initiated by the extension host.",
