			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Standardize IPC handlers with centralized effect macro and parameter helpers\n\nIntroduce the `effect!` macro in `MappedEffectType` to eliminate verbose boilerplate for wrapping async logic into `MappedEffect` closures. Concurrently add the `Utilities::Params` module providing type-safe, default-aware argument extractors (`string_at`, `val_at`, `u64_at`, etc.) for handling `serde_json::Value` payloads.\n\nApply these utilities across the entire `Track/Effect/CreateEffectForRequest` tree, including `Authentication`, `FileSystem`, `Terminal`, `WindowUI`, and `Workspace` handlers. Refactor `WindServiceHandlers/mod.rs` to introduce the `call!` macro, replacing repetitive `dev_log!` and closure invocation patterns with a unified dispatch mechanism for Tauri IPC commands.\n\nThis consolidation reduces code duplication, enforces consistent parameter extraction and logging behavior, and aligns the native backend with the project's Effect-TS driven architectural principles.",
